<title>SWITZERLAND: CSFB advises expanding holdings in Bucher.</title>
<headline>CSFB advises expanding holdings in Bucher.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it had raised its earnings estimates for Bucher Holding AG and recommended investors increase their holdings in the diversified machinery group.</p>
<p>It set its 12-month share price target at 1,500 Swiss francs. Bearer shares were down seven to 1,292 at 1015 GMT.</p>
<p>CSFB raised its 1997 EPS estimate to 126 francs from 93. It gave a new 1998 estimate of 138 francs.</p>
<p>Bucher reported this week that 1996 group net soared 37.3 percent to 49.3 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
